@raspberriesId = d4ef41a3-d1cf-39c1-9fc8-daa897c5b750
@wedelId = aaaaaaaa-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
@chocolateId = bbbbbbbb-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### Event CREATE: nowa firma w company-service → 201
PUT http://localhost:8081/api/companies/{{wedelId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Wedel", "nip": "5250008237", "isPolish": true }

### food-service zna już Wedla → 200 i pusta lista (przed krokiem 2 było 404)
GET http://localhost:8082/api/companies/{{wedelId}}/foods

### Produkt dla Wedla → 201
PUT http://localhost:8082/api/companies/{{wedelId}}/foods/{{chocolateId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Mleczna czekolada", "price": 8, "quantity": 120 }

### Event DELETE: usunięcie Legsadu w company-service → 204
DELETE http://localhost:8081/api/companies/{{legsadId}}

### Produkt Legsadu zniknął z food-service → 404
GET http://localhost:8082/api/foods/{{raspberriesId}}